         msbuild -p:GameVersion="2.6 b12"
       Defaults to the current release. Everything version-specific (game-assembly
       HintPaths, the deploy Mods folder, the release zip name, and a GV_* compile
       symbol) derives from this one property. Add a version by copying a block below. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <GameVersion Condition="'$(GameVersion)' == ''">3.0.0 b259</GameVersion>
    <!-- Debug builds rewrite the DEPLOYED settings.xml MusicPath to this; override with
         -p:DebugMusicPath=... . Release ships the committed value ("Music") untouched. -->
